 wrestler turned film star, The Rock, recently posted a picture of himself posing next to a 'You'll Never Walk Alone' artwork, hinting that he is a Liverpool fan. He captioned the post with background information on the song, which was originally a show tune in a musical but was later adopted by Liverpool Football Club as anthem. The Rock mentions the song's moving performances by stadium masses but doesn't say if he watched Liverpool's recent defeat to Manchester United, which would have left him feeling ' rock bottom'.
